Brick Break, Bulk Up, Calm Mind from four badges; Energy Ball, X-Scissor, Stone
Edge from six); Goldenrod 3F the five pinch berries from six badges; Goldenrod
2F Dive, Luxury, Repeat and Timer Balls from two; and Celadon 4F the four
weather rocks. Made by tools/hack/gap_items.py.

